  "page": "page-06",
  "idea": "Automated sprint retro board with anonymous feedback collection",
  "text": "This automated board lets remote team members submit feedback anonymously so real engineering issues surface. When retros require public attribution, developers hold back to avoid offending managers or tech leads. Hiding genuine friction behind polite praise allows broken CI/CD pipelines to derail future sprints. EasyRetro collects masked feedback cards all week and enables blind upvoting on top blockers. This exposes critical delivery roadblocks without defensive arguments.",
